{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;MOtion Wulin&quot; \u2013 A Wuxia Action Game of Time-Traveling Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Worldview: Shattered Time, Interwoven Martial Realms]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Content</strong><br>This is a martial arts-themed action combat game where players assume the role of a warrior, challenging various enemies and enhancing their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br><i>&quot;Rifts in time appear, warriors from all eras gather; a single strike decides fate, all realms merge into one path.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2045, a quantum experiment accidentally tears the fabric of time, causing martial artists from different dynasties to converge in the modern world. As a special agent of the &quot;Time-Space Administration,&quot; you must travel across different eras, battle formidable foes, and restore the fractured timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong><br><strong>[Dynamic Martial Arts]</strong> \u2013 A fully free-form combat control system that puts complete weapon mastery in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.poster.avif?t=1769269452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.webm?t=1769269452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/9ffd91325aac650c5d841a41d759877f.mp4?t=1769269452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enemy's blade strikes\u2014will you raise your sword to block, sidestep to evade, or deflect with a well-timed parry? The system calculates weapon collisions and force direction in real time. Success depends on your reflexes and skill, not random chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.poster.avif?t=1769269452\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.webm?t=1769269452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/extras/19e8793f0280d3baa12bf9beecbc4e86.mp4?t=1769269452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1932720?t=1769269452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1932720?t=1769269452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/bf005efc37ad14ac1335322d52e08a7cbfe1a55b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769269452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932720/bf005efc37ad14ac1335322d52e08a7cbfe1a55b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769269452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3854100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;MOtion Wulin&quot; \u2013 A Wuxia Action Game of Time-Traveling Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Worldview: Shattered Time, Interwoven Martial Realms]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par